iRiel Skills Library

Portable Agent Skills for building and operating iRiel as the Personal Intelligence Environment (PIE) created by Robert Software Labs.

Import

In Lovable, open Workspace settings → Skills → Add → Import from GitHub. Import individual Skill directories containing a SKILL.md.

