Format and scope

Each Skill is a standalone directory with portable Agent Skills YAML frontmatter and operational instructions. Skills describe procedures; they are not executable Tools or runtime code. Use the coordinated implementation package in docs/skills/ as the master guide for evolving the existing AppWeb.